    "moon": "the position behind was chosen and is not up for review, so the reading changes nothing about where you stand. what it changes is the account. every dated observation goes into the same file as the admiration, and both keep — so you are following at full commitment and holding an itemised record of the decline, and the two have coexisted for so long that neither feels like a contradiction.",
