    "tension": "loyal is what gets said, and nobody near you can find a crack in it, which is accurate as far as it goes and stops well short. the record is the part that cannot surface. producing it would mean saying out loud that you have been reading one person at that resolution for the whole of it, and that sentence converts two decades of loyalty into something with another name before you have finished saying it.",
    "cost": "you can stay behind somebody through the exact stretch when staying stopped making sense, and name that stretch to the month, and stay anyway. the reading has not once moved your feet. calling an ending early is the whole of the talent, and the only case where the call and the grip land on one person is the one that has run your whole life."
