    "cost": "nine years out you can pick up a thread mid-sentence — the names, the grudge, where it was left — and people find that uncanny and useful in equal measure. openings arrive at the old rate and nothing has ever closed, so a faculty designed for travelling light is hauling a population, and each new one gets a thinner share than the one before it."
