    "moon": "raising a pause lightly is not available. whatever leaves you arrives whole, at a volume the evidence cannot support, and lands as an accusation whoever you are, because no undo has exactly one setting. so the small things do not come out small; they wait. what eventually gets said is whatever grew large enough to justify the only exit available.",
