    "moon": "everything else about you is out where anyone can reach it — the mood, the money, who you like. the spread does not keep a private room. so the readings sit in the only closed place you own, and one closed place in a house with no doors is louder than a locked house. people can point at where it is. they have simply never been able to open it.",
