    "moon": "when it goes, it goes in one motion. no tapering, no trial separation, no half a year of being slightly less there — the version of you that lived in that house is gone inside a week, entire. what does not go is the year. you shed the person who sat through it and keep every evening he sat through, at the resolution he took them in.",
