    "tension": "cold is the finding, and it is entered by people who saw one evening of it. the defence exists — a year of it, dated, in order — and running it means saying out loud that you knew twelve months before you moved and stayed the whole time, which turns a sudden departure into a year of sitting in a house with the reading already finished. so you take ruthless. it is the cheaper account.",
    "cost": "nobody in that house got a bad year out of you. the birthdays were done properly, the holiday was booked, and the person you had already finished with got twelve months of somebody who showed up. the weather takes the life and leaves the people in it exactly where they sat in you — eight years out, remarried, you still hold her at the resolution of that last year."
