    "moon": "what leaves the hands here goes without a tally, so the fix gets adopted, renamed, improved by people who never asked what it was for. none of the reason travels with it. that stays where it was taken, at the resolution of the afternoon it went in, which is the part he could have used and the part nobody has ever been handed.",
