    "cost": "you can take a decline in somebody and have a working arrangement around it inside a fortnight, so nobody is humiliated and nothing has to be said out loud. the account is what nobody gets. the people nearest you run on adjustments built for reasons they have never heard, and every reason is still legible, in full, in the one head it will never leave."
