    "sun": "a beat behind the hesitation, the conclusion is already complete — the answer given too readily, the name used in a slightly different way, what those two add up to. arriving that fast is the whole talent. arriving that fast in company is the difficulty, because the timing is legible from outside: people can tell what you were looking at when it landed, and the timing tells them it was them.",
    "moon": "no layer sits between the reading and the room. the undefended part usually shows itself in what gets taken from you. here it governs what gets out. so people watch you reach the true state of their situation while they are still describing a better one, and they come away having been caught rather than understood, by somebody who cannot arrange a face.",
