    "cost": "flattery does not survive contact with you, so anyone who stays has already been read to their face and knows exactly where they stand, which people find restful once they are over it. the ones who leave, leave early. the readings you would have kept go out anyway, unbidden, to people who then hold something about you that was never offered to them."
