    "moon": "neither attachment is a hedge against the other. each one goes the whole way in and stays at that depth, and no part of you stands by to rank them, so when it breaks, neither side is the one that can be dropped. you come out of somebody's divorce holding two people, two complete versions of one decade, and the closeness each of them had the week before.",
