    "moon": "an agreement here is built to outlast the feeling that produced it, and this one was produced in an evening. no review comes round. no clause covers the case where the man you read has since become somebody else. so the terms stand at the shape a single look gave them, held by the only person who knows they exist, against someone who never agreed to anything.",
