    "tension": "the day you step out of one of these it will look arbitrary to everyone watching, because the reasons were entered a decade back in a room where nothing was said aloud. reliable is what follows you around, and the word fits the surface exactly. underneath it, the arrangement cannot be dissolved by agreement, since agreement would need a second person who knew they were in one.",
    "cost": "people can put weight on you thirty years out and it holds, because you read what they would need before they asked and took it on privately, so nobody has had to ask twice. each of those undertakings is still running at the size it was set, and none can be retired: retiring one means naming the evening, and the look, that set it."
