    "sun": "everyone has had all of you since the first year — the time, the door, the answer at eleven at night. a refusal from the eldest lands because it comes from the only place with nothing above it, and it lands hardest on people who do not get much of you. the deference is intact, undamaged by any of it, and the refusals have nothing left to travel on.",
    "moon": "The Mane was never going to sit closed at the top of a building. being looked at has been comfortable since you were small, so the isolation the post hands out arrived and found no purchase — you stayed open, at the size you always were, in a position that works by being partly withheld. the spread is genuine. it is also the whole supply, spent daily.",
    "pull": "the building has your home number and has never needed permission for a minute of your time. your first refusal will be the only one on record, and it will be read as a mood.",
    "tension": "approachable follows you around, meant warmly, by people who have never had to test it. things that should stop at your door go four rounds instead, because nobody below you has learned what your refusal looks like — they have only learned that you will hear it again tomorrow. the one occasion you shut something down flat went round the floor for two years as the day you were not yourself.",
    "cost": "you know what is actually going on down there, unedited, because reaching you has never cost anybody anything — which is uncommon at the top of a place. every decision you want held has to be argued from scratch, like a colleague's, and the ones you lose go to people who could not have taken anything off you if any of it had been kept in reserve."
