    "tension": "indiscreet is the charge, and the sequence that would prove it is missing — no conversation where you passed anything on, no moment of deciding to. the material simply showed. people who tell you things do it because being heard by you is the best hour they get, and then find their own words in circulation and go quiet, and the going quiet is never explained, so it happens again with the next one.",
    "cost": "hand you something half-thought and it comes out again enlarged, sorted, in better light than its owner could have given it, which is a genuine service and the reason the supply never stops. the lighting has one setting. what was said to you at two in the morning gets the same treatment as a joke, with whoever is in the room watching."
