    "moon": "and The Veil leaves no seam on the outside of any of it. the room meets a person it cannot move and gets nothing about how the contents arrived. the same layer holds from your side: being convinced is an event, with a conversation attached and a date, and you have no such event to recall, so the whole set reads to you as arrived at rather than delivered.",
