    "tension": "people call you your own person, admiringly, usually just after failing to talk you into something reasonable. the ones who love you make cases, because that is what care looks like, and a case is the one delivery method that has never worked here. meanwhile a stranger says a flat sentence at a bad moment and it takes up residence for life. nobody has worked out that the argument is the disqualifier.",
    "cost": "pressure that reorganises everybody else in the room leaves you where you were — a bad year, a majority, a fashion in what serious people think, and the position holds. whatever is wrong in there has the same tenure. it cannot be got out by the ordinary instrument, so your revisions have all arrived by accident, from people who were not trying, and you cannot arrange for one."
