    "cost": "people commit properly inside this — jobs, mortgages, a child's whole education — because a floor nobody has to think about is the rare thing that makes committing possible at all. a structure is normally maintained by whoever lives inside it. the upkeep here is one body producing a week, and no version of the arrangement has anybody else taking a turn."
