    "moon": "the method needs a reply, and the delivered do not reply — a person who has arrived has a country to get on with, and quiet from that direction is the sign the work took. so the returns come off people still in transit. your reading of your own effect is assembled entirely from the middle of journeys, none of which you have seen the end of.",
