    "cost": "a bad passage removes the week, and you supply one — on time, at length, to somebody with nothing else fixed in their year, which is why people get across at all. arrival ends it. the far side is where the schedule stops reaching, so the settled are names you would have to write to in order to learn anything, and the writing has no slot."
