    "moon": "the cord holds at any length, so nothing is lost by putting an ocean in the middle — and nothing is gained by removing one. tension does not report proximity. a person who packs up their life and takes the flat downstairs arrives into the same fortnightly slot they had from abroad, and finds that being nearby was not a category you had.",
